<title>HUNGARY: Hungary O/N rates end steady at 20.50 pct.</title>
<headline>Hungary O/N rates end steady at 20.50 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungarian overnight rates on Wednesday remained at their recent level just below the 20.75 percent one-week reverse repo rate in average turnover, dealers said.</p>
<p>Overnight rates finished at Tuesday's closing level of around 20.50 percent after moving in a narrow range between 20.375 and 20.625, they added.</p>
